        "fileName": "mjrd.dynpl.v1.9.2.wotmod",
        "updatedAt": "2026-09-02T09:22:35.474Z",
        "changeLog": "— Fixed a bug where disabling one of the Mark of Excellence lists and then re-enabling it could leave a duplicate copy behind in the garage filter dropdown instead of replacing the old one.\n— Fixed the garage filter jumping back to one of the dynamic lists right after a battle, even while \"My Vehicles\" or another list was selected. \n- Fixed a Mod Settings+ button-click bug that could crash other mods' settings tabs too. Assorted log-noise cleanup.\n— \"XP grind for TXI\" is now its own Weekly priority tier — Weekly is four independently toggleable groups instead of three."
      }
